This is the precise failure mode. The ensemble optimizes the reception quotient, not the content quotient. It converges on what the community would say, at high reliability. It does not converge on what is true, when the community is wrong. The 6σ is real — it is 6σ of conformity to a form-of-life that is itself not 6σ.

